--- !u!114 &2134680314
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2134680311}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: fe16c5afa4916814b86aab10fcf795de, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::HazardDialogue
  hazardName: Octopus Wiring
  lines:
  - text: "That's octopus wiring \u2014 one outlet with too many devices plugged
      into it."
    characterPose: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1df00db9a1101574d87e2b5df19761c5, type: 3}
    demoVideo: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Every outlet can only carry so much power. Plug in too much, and the wires
      start to heat up.
    characterPose: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1df00db9a1101574d87e2b5df19761c5, type: 3}
    demoVideo: {fileID: 0}
  - text: 'The heat builds slowly. Insulation melts, and a fire can start inside
      the wall where nobody notices until it spreads. '
    characterPose: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6dabcd07478f38b4384467fb682f154c, type: 3}
    demoVideo: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Chaining extension cords together doesn't help \u2014 it just hides the
      problem. The load is still there, and every extra connection adds more heat"
    characterPose: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6dabcd07478f38b4384467fb682f154c, type: 3}
    demoVideo: {fileID: 0}
  - text: ' Report the unsafe wiring. Never fix it yourself,

      A licensed electrician
      should handle it. Head to the phone and report this hazard.'
    characterPose: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2cb2c185d83af914aa26b4c0fb08c86f, type: 3}
    demoVideo: {fileID: 0}
  completionLines:
  - text: Good work. Maintenance has been notified, and an electrician will inspect
      the wiring.
    characterPose: {fileID: 21300000, guid: dc86be78c176b7249911c3e5eec98bf6, type: 3}
    demoVideo: {fileID: 0}
  - text: 'Reported and handled. That wiring won''t be a risk now.

'
    characterPose: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2cb2c185d83af914aa26b4c0fb08c86f, type: 3}
    demoVideo: {fileID: 0}
  actionTarget: {fileID: 0}
  isComplete: 0
